name probe_v2_capacity_drop
describe Capacity drops from 2.5 Mbps to 500 kbps at 10 s and recovers at 25 s, `cc v2` and `pacer v2` (#48)
# libwebrtc (parity-data, 10 seeds): utilization 57.5 %, video 895 kbps, 2.2 freezes (2.5 s), max settle 14.8 s.
# This library with the port: 58.9 %, 898 kbps, 1.7 freezes (3.0 s), max settle 13.7 s.
cc v2
pacer v2
duration 40s
at 0s  capacity=2500kbps delay=30ms queue=400ms
at 10s capacity=500kbps
at 25s capacity=2500kbps
expect audio.interruptions <= 1
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 4000
expect cc.utilization_pct >= 52
expect cc.max_settle_ms < 20000
